Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:21:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Website AI chat widget with team hand-off
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- One-line embed (<script src=".../w/embed/<token>.js">) adds a chat button
  that opens the chat window from the console.
- The assistant answers from approved knowledge, offers and books open
  times, takes messages (needs an email or phone), and hands off when a
  person is requested, the AI is off, paused or out of plan requests.
- Staff inbox under AI receptionist → Website chat: transcripts, reply as
  the team (pauses the AI), let the AI answer again, close, open contact.
- Visitors are known only by a random browser ID (hashed); chats, AI and
  visitor messages are server-written; history is append-only; each AI
  reply is metered as an AI request.
- Phone and chat share one receptionist core (facts, times, booking,
  messages). Home shows chats that need a person.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
